<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Arise! Arise! And open up your mouth,</l><l>Join in the praise and let your spirit out.</l><l>He is rich unto all those who call upon His name;</l><l>Together now His riches we proclaim.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
